description.narrative:
Output: Results Area 1: Quality of DepEd SHS program improved Indicator: 1g. At least 75% of DepEd SHSs have career counsellors or advocates by 2019 (2014 baseline: None) Achievement: 75 Progress/Status: Achieved.
Based on data from different regional and schools division offices reports submitted in compliance with the Office of the Undersecretary for Administration (OUA) Memorandum No. 09-0319-0145 dated 27 March 2019, there are 247 registered guidance counselors (RGCs) holding Guidance Counselors&apos; item/plantilla;
123 RGCs holding teaching post and plantilla, 302 non-RGC but holding guidance counselors&apos; item/plantilla;
4,872 non-RGC with designation as guidance counselor/guidance teacher and 5,664 teachers designated as career advocates, majority of whom (4,056 or 72%) are female. Data Source: EBEIS
